    "title": "Albany community reacts to end of 988 specialized service for LGBTQ youth, Court decision - NewsBreak",
    "text": "WRGB\nwebsite\nAlbany\nAlbany community reacts to end of 988 specialized service for LGBTQ youth, Court decision\nBy Tom Eschen,\n1 hours agoAlbany — The federal government says it will no longer pay for specialized suicide prevention support for LGBTQ+ people. The 988 hotline launched a pilot program for LGBTQ+ plus youth in 2022, but, despite more than one million people using the line since its inception, that will be going away. The federal government says instead they'll focus on the main hotline.\n1",
